    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scav</strong> is about scavenging \u2014 survive the raid, or lose everything trying.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scav</strong> is a low poly looter shooter with survival elements, set in a world where every infected zone is scheduled for nuclear extermination. When the outbreak hits, you're dropped in to scavenge what\u2019s left \u2014 and get out before the blast.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your journey in the <strong>safezone</strong>, a private haven where you can store your gear, stash your cash in the bank, buy weapons, tools, and properties, or customize your character's appearance. Stock up at vendor shops, prepare your loadout, and ready up for the next raid.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load into an abandoned, overgrown city \u2014 a quarantine zone surrounded by sand and the dead. You've got one goal: loot everything you can before the nuclear sanitation protocol wipes the place off the map. With a ticking clock, hostile scavengers, and the infected roaming the ruins, every raid is a deadly gamble.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search buildings, underground bunkers, and radiation zones for valuable gear and rare items. Secure what you can, extract alive, and return home \u2014 or die and lose it all.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in properties to unlock storage, perks, and long-term upgrades. Plan your builds around upcoming farming and production systems like drug cultivation and manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scav</strong> is about scavenging \u2014 survive the raid, or lose everything trying.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scav</strong> is a low poly looter shooter with survival elements, set in a world where every infected zone is scheduled for nuclear extermination. When the outbreak hits, you're dropped in to scavenge what\u2019s left \u2014 and get out before the blast.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your journey in the <strong>safezone</strong>, a private haven where you can store your gear, stash your cash in the bank, buy weapons, tools, and properties, or customize your character's appearance. Stock up at vendor shops, prepare your loadout, and ready up for the next raid.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load into an abandoned, overgrown city \u2014 a quarantine zone surrounded by sand and the dead. You've got one goal: loot everything you can before the nuclear sanitation protocol wipes the place off the map. With a ticking clock, hostile scavengers, and the infected roaming the ruins, every raid is a deadly gamble.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search buildings, underground bunkers, and radiation zones for valuable gear and rare items. Secure what you can, extract alive, and return home \u2014 or die and lose it all.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in properties to unlock storage, perks, and long-term upgrades. Plan your builds around upcoming farming and production systems like drug cultivation and manufacturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Scav is a low poly looter shooter with survival elements. Gear up in the safezone, drop into quarantine zones, scavenge valuable loot, fight enemies and zombies, and extract before the nuke hits. Survive the raid or lose everything.",
